<title>USA: Terrace in pact to buy wholesaler.</title>
<headline>Terrace in pact to buy wholesaler.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Terrace Holdings Inc said Monday it had reached a final agreement to acquire the assets and related liabilities of A One A Wholesale Produce Inc, a privately owned produce distributor.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, A One A will become a wholly owned subsidiary of Terrace Holdings. Together, the companies have annual revenues of more than $28 million, Terrace said.</p>
